# AWS Deployment Guide for AstroTask (ECS Fargate)

This guide walks you through deploying AstroTask to AWS using the Console UI. CLI commands are only used where they make sense (building Docker images locally).

**Architecture:**
- **Domain:** astrotask.io (single domain with /api for backend)
- **Estimated Cost:** ~$60-80/month

---

## How Everything Connects

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Namecheap DNS                                │
│               astrotask.io → ALB DNS name                       │
│                                                                 │
│  You'll add a CNAME record pointing to the Load Balancer       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                │
                                ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              Application Load Balancer (ALB)                    │
│                                                                 │
│  - Receives all traffic on ports 80 and 443                   │
│  - Terminates SSL (handles HTTPS)                              │
│  - Routes /api/* to Backend, everything else to Frontend       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                     │                    │
              /api/* routes         All other routes
                     │                    │
                     ▼                    ▼
┌──────────────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────────────┐
│    ECS Fargate Service   │  │    ECS Fargate Service   │
│       (Backend)          │  │       (Frontend)         │
│                          │  │                          │
│  - Runs your Go API      │  │  - Runs Next.js app      │
│  - Gets secrets from     │  │  - API URL baked in at   │
│    Secrets Manager       │  │    build time            │
│  - Connects to RDS       │  │                          │
└──────────────────────────┘  └──────────────────────────┘
              │
              ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    RDS PostgreSQL 16                            │
│                                                                 │
│  - Managed database (AWS handles backups, updates)             │
│  - Only accessible from ECS tasks (not public internet)        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

