## Updating Your App

When you push code changes:

```bash
# Rebuild images
docker build -t astrotask-backend ./backend
docker tag astrotask-backend:latest $AWS_ACCOUNT_ID.dkr.ecr.$AWS_REGION.amazonaws.com/astrotask-backend:latest
docker push $AWS_ACCOUNT_ID.dkr.ecr.$AWS_REGION.amazonaws.com/astrotask-backend:latest

# Force ECS to pull new image
aws ecs update-service \
  --cluster astrotask-cluster \
  --service astrotask-backend-service \
  --force-new-deployment
```

Or in the Console:
1. Go to **ECS** → **Clusters** → **Services**
2. Select the service → **Update**
3. Check **Force new deployment**
4. Click **Update**

